HB0106 Monument to America.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Harshman, Byron and Sherwood and
Senator(s) Anderson, Brennan and Landen
AN ACT relating to the administration of government; creating the monument to
America development and oversight task force; providing duties of the task
force; requiring a report; providing appropriations; and providing for an
effective date.
